"""
omniroute_config_clone.py
=========================
Creates a clean SQLite clone of the Omniroute database containing:
  1. Configuration tables WITH data (routing, providers, keys, quotas, etc.)
  2. Operational/telemetry tables WITHOUT data (empty schemas preserved)

The result preserves the complete schema while dropping accumulated logs,
telemetry, conversation history, and caches. This allows the backup to be
restored without carrying 400MB of unnecessary runtime data.

Also copies the .env file alongside the clone so the environment is
fully reproducible.

Usage:
    python omniroute_config_clone.py [--db PATH] [--env PATH] [--out-dir PATH]

Defaults:
    --db      D:/My Drive/Sync/Config/omniroute/storage.sqlite
    --env     D:/My Drive/Sync/Config/omniroute/.env
